Modifications extract the sheath equations and root search into a standalone
library with physical inputs and results. Application-specific array contracts,
boundary response adapters, continuation/restart state, inactive outflow moments,
and population-fraction coupling have been removed. Process termination has
been replaced with status results. Particle flux and current outputs were added.

